Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:00:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] fix(seats): a seat is written whole or not at all, and a
 taken slot moves on (ops 11:28Z)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Two 500s at 11:23Z: „UserPhone_phone_key" — the free number was taken
between the pick and the insert. The account, its number and its seat row
were three separate writes, so each clash left an empty account behind
(181485, 181488). They are now one transaction, and an auto-picked number
that clashes moves to the next free slot (up to 3 tries). A number the
caller chose is never swapped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
